#: ../../functions/func_inmulti.rst:14
msgid ""
"Returns true if the multi-value variable ``multi`` contains exactly "
"``value`` as one of its values. Note that comparisons are case-sensitive."
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_inmulti.rst:16
msgid ""
"A literal value representing a multi-value can be substituted for ``multi``, "
"using the ``separator`` (or a semicolon followed by a space \"; \" if not "
"passed) to coerce the value into a proper multi-valued variable."
msgstr ""

